5
00:00:42,240 --> 00:00:45,295
We're going to talk about leverage today, okay? The big L word.

6
00:00:45,295 --> 00:00:50,970
Now, the wonderful thing about leverage is it's a term that not many people talk about.

7
00:00:50,970 --> 00:00:52,610
People are afraid to talk about leverage.

8
00:00:52,610 --> 00:00:52,880
Why?

9
00:00:52,880 --> 00:00:58,055
Because look at every advert you see on the CNBC, the Bloombergs, the, you know, these spreadbacks.

10
00:00:58,055 --> 00:00:59,282
All of them talk about,

11
00:00:59,282 --> 00:01:01,000
you know, risk of loss being more

12
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:03,454
than your initial capital and, you know, leverage is bad.

13
00:01:03,455 --> 00:01:09,585
And, you know, if you use leverage, effectively, you know, you're effectively risking 20, 30% of your account on any given trade.

14
00:01:09,585 --> 00:01:14,025
So, what's been advertised out there is that leverage is a bad thing, okay?

15
00:01:14,025 --> 00:01:17,135
