21
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:39,747
Now, if there's one thing you guys can learn from today, it's

22
00:01:39,747 --> 00:01:43,494
ultimately that, you know, us as traders, us as professional traders, what

23
00:01:43,494 --> 00:01:52,238
