00:02:44,180 --> 00:02:47,840
the big macro hedge funds that choose to create these algos, okay?

42
00:02:47,840 --> 00:02:50,855
So, leverage in a sense of the word.

43
00:02:50,855 --> 00:02:56,785
Now, what did I want to talk about in terms of the leverage is, obviously, the pros, okay?

44
00:02:56,785 --> 00:02:59,645
Yes, you can scale up, you can make a lot more money.

45
00:02:59,645 --> 00:03:04,820
Yes, you know, you can make better returns over the long run, okay?

46
00:03:04,820 --> 00:03:07,900
