00:04:24,700 --> 00:04:26,520
There's going to be a psychological impact.

70
00:04:26,520 --> 00:04:30,020
Now, it's important to understand that psychological impact because what

71
00:04:30,020 --> 00:04:32,820
I found very early in my career was

72
00:04:32,820 --> 00:04:34,920
I really battled with increasing the

73
00:04:34,920 --> 00:04:39,820
