74
00:04:39,820 --> 00:04:43,586
So, if you can understand and accept that by the very nature

75
00:04:43,586 --> 00:04:45,469
of taking on more risk, your

76
00:04:45,469 --> 00:04:51,119
downside is equally going to have to look a little bit different and feel a bit different, right?

