87
00:05:25,960 --> 00:05:28,085
There is no change to the process.

88
00:05:28,085 --> 00:05:31,695
Why? Because the market will take you on a one lot or a four lot.

89
00:05:31,695 --> 00:05:35,475
There's enough liquidity, again, depending on the market you're trading, okay?

